sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Request
    participant Pre as Prefill
    participant KV as KV cache
    participant Dec as Decode
    participant U as User
    R->>Pre: the whole prompt at once
    Pre->>KV: fill the cache for every prompt token
    Note over Pre: compute-bound, parallel across tokens — this sets time-to-first-token
    Pre->>Dec: hand over
    loop one token at a time
        Dec->>KV: read all previous keys and values
        Dec->>KV: append this token's
        Dec-->>U: stream the token
    end
    Note over Dec,KV: memory-bandwidth-bound and strictly sequential — this sets inter-token latency
    Note over KV: cache size = layers x heads x sequence length x batch. It is the real capacity limit
